  "policy_analysis_constraints": [
    "No welfare ranking or country recommendation from cost alone",
    "No blanket assertion Taiwan lacks all frontier AI model research or no sovereign AI efforts",
    "Do not replace sustained-run costs with one final training bill",
    "Never sum hypothetical revenue and national social value without conversion",
    "Cloud rental and owned hardware depreciation are alternative accounting pathways unless disjoint hardware",
    "Training chip-hours not model parameter count or deployed GPU announcement",
    "Private capital investment (US/CN) is not government spending and is not direct model-building expense",
    "Epoch 2024 cost trend and 2027 >1B conditional projection must not be treated as 2026 verified actuals",
    "Corporate company capex cannot all be assigned to AI training",
    "Country tech strength is not identical to ability or desire to operate a top general model lab",
    "Small model development can be original research; API usage is different from independent model creation",
    "Open-weight licensing and lawful fine-tuning need explicit original-model license checks",
